{%- comment -%}
  maps/wms-soap-response-to-json.liquid
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Transform:   WMS SOAP 1.1 CreateOrderResponse  →  BMWC canonical JSON status
  Engine:      DotLiquid  (Logic Apps Standard built-in Liquid action)
  Map kind:    JsonToJson   (input is the JSON object produced by xml() function)
  Map path:    logic-app/lib/maps/wms-soap-response-to-json.liquid
  Map name:    wms-soap-response-to-json
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  PRE-PROCESSING REQUIRED in the workflow (Compose_Parse_WMS_Response action):
    This map receives the WMS response AFTER the HTTP XML body has been
    converted to a JSON object using the Logic Apps xml() function.

    Action: Compose_Parse_WMS_Response
      inputs: "@xml(body('Call_WMS_SOAP_Endpoint'))"

    The xml() function converts XML namespace-prefixed element names into JSON
    keys using the prefix:localname format. Colons in key names require bracket
    notation in DotLiquid:
      content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']

  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  RESPONSE SHAPES handled by this map:

  Shape A — Success response (HTTP 200, no fault):
    <soapenv:Envelope>
      <soapenv:Body>
        <wms:CreateOrderResponse>
          <wms:Status>ACCEPTED</wms:Status>
          <wms:WmsOrderId>WMS-xxx</wms:WmsOrderId>
          <wms:Message>Order received and queued for processing</wms:Message>
          <wms:EstimatedReadyDate>2026-04-10T00:00:00Z</wms:EstimatedReadyDate>
          <wms:WarehouseRef>WH-SIN-ORD-2026-SGP-001</wms:WarehouseRef>
        </wms:CreateOrderResponse>
      </soapenv:Body>
    </soapenv:Envelope>

  Shape B — SOAP Fault (HTTP 200 with fault in body, or HTTP 500):
    <soapenv:Envelope>
      <soapenv:Body>
        <soapenv:Fault>
          <faultcode>wms:InvalidWarehouse</faultcode>
          <faultstring>Warehouse code WH-XXX not found in WMS master data</faultstring>
          <detail>
            <wms:ErrorDetail>
              <wms:ErrorCode>WMS-4001</wms:ErrorCode>
              <wms:ErrorMessage>Warehouse code WH-XXX not found</wms:ErrorMessage>
            </wms:ErrorDetail>
          </detail>
        </soapenv:Fault>
      </soapenv:Body>
    </soapenv:Envelope>

  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  NOTE: Do not add timezone conversion here.
    - All timestamps from WMS are expected in UTC.
    - The Logic App's utcNow() is added to the telemetry log in the workflow,
      not in this map.
    - GMT+8 localisation is strictly a reporting-layer concern (KQL dashboards).
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ALTERNATIVE — xpath() expressions (recommended for targeted extraction):
    If the WMS WSDL is known, prefer xpath() expressions in Compose actions
    over this Liquid map for individual field extraction. Example:
      xpath(xml(body('Call_WMS_SOAP_Endpoint')),
            'string(/*[local-name()="Envelope"]/*[local-name()="Body"]
                      /*[local-name()="CreateOrderResponse"]
                      /*[local-name()="WmsOrderId"])')
    local-name() avoids namespace prefix binding issues entirely.
{%- endcomment -%}
{
  "isFault": {%- if content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['soapenv:Fault'] -%}true{%- else -%}false{%- endif -%},

  "success": {
    "status":               "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['wms:CreateOrderResponse']['wms:Status'] | default: '' -}}",
    "wmsOrderId":           "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['wms:CreateOrderResponse']['wms:WmsOrderId'] | default: '' -}}",
    "message":              "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['wms:CreateOrderResponse']['wms:Message'] | default: '' -}}",
    "estimatedReadyDate":   "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['wms:CreateOrderResponse']['wms:EstimatedReadyDate'] | default: '' -}}",
    "warehouseRef":         "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['wms:CreateOrderResponse']['wms:WarehouseRef'] | default: '' -}}"
  },

  "fault": {
    "faultcode":    "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['soapenv:Fault']['faultcode'] | default: '' -}}",
    "faultstring":  "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['soapenv:Fault']['faultstring'] | default: '' -}}",
    "errorCode":    "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['soapenv:Fault']['detail']['wms:ErrorDetail']['wms:ErrorCode'] | default: '' -}}",
    "errorMessage": "{{- content['soapenv:Envelope']['soapenv:Body']['soapenv:Fault']['detail']['wms:ErrorDetail']['wms:ErrorMessage'] | default: '' -}}"
  }
}
